<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0670_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Alfred</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Well, now that we acquainted, shall we\nexchange telephonic numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lovely!\nNow I can call you anytime.\fI shall call at a respectable hour.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\rLike I figured, young folks rather\nhang with people their own age...\fI’ll go feed the pigeons. Alone.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You don’t deadass wanna swap numbers\nwith an old man, do you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s wrong? Ain’t we on the same\nfloor right now?\rWhy not talk face-to-face, like\ngentlemen?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was SO shook!\nA few days ago I got a NOCTOWL in\fa trade.\rTurns out it was the SAME NOCTOWL I\ntraded away years ago!\rWhat goes around comes around!\nIt’s a small world after all!\fIt’s mad at me though. It remembers.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s kinda disappointin’.\nA few days ago I got a NOCTOWL in\fa trade.\rIt looked SO familiar...\nI thought it was my NOCTOWL!\rI was so moved... I cried.\fThen I looked closer. Different owl.\rThat kinda thing can’t happen, right?\nI cried for nothin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whenever I try to catch a wild homie,\nthey always run away.\rA RATTATA got away just the other day.\rI always take off my hat and introduce\nmyself proper, and THAT’S when they\fdip.\rRATTATA got NO manners...\fNone. Zero. Raised by wolves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ha ha, you wanna scrap again?\nI think that’s a FINE idea!\rI’ll meet you at {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\fI’ll wear my good hat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everything aight?\nYou forget our appointment?\rI’m waitin’ at {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nPunctuality is a virtue!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0670_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When I call a young person like you, we\ncan swap info.\rHomies bring people together, don’t\nthey?\fTruly extraordinary creatures.\fBetter than my grandkids. They don’t\ncall.</language>
	</row>
</body>
